<h1 data-copy-en="Kitty" data-copy-zh="Kitty">Kitty</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Meet Kitty at the Syndicate Big Top, unlock repeatable conversations and Rogue training, and follow her personal route." data-copy-zh="在辛迪加大帐篷认识 Kitty，开放日常交谈与盗贼训练，再按顺序推进个人路线。">Meet Kitty at the Syndicate Big Top, unlock repeatable conversations and Rogue training, and follow her personal route.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 8 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shared_Scenes_with_Saber"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Best_Syndicate_Choice_Bonuses"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shared_Syndicate_Missions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Kitty_Style"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="On_the_Prowl_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_Relationship_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Cat.27s_Eyes_and_Taming_the_Rookie"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Cat's_Eyes_and_Taming_the_Rookie"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Meeting_Kitty_and_Unlocking_Talk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Kitty — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kitty.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Kitty — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kitty.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Kitty — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Kitty is a Syndicate contact at The Big Top. Shared missions provide the early affection needed to open her repeatable Talk and Rogue Training. Her personal scenes then progress through the relationship stages, with an optional date, an animation and later shared scenes with Saber.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Schedule_and_Daily_Actions"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p><strong>The Big Top, Syndicate Gates, Future Prime Sector: all day, every day.</strong> From the gates, use To The Parlor for the shared introduction, then To The Big Top for Kitty’s first meeting. The Den and Prime Transportation Nexus Hub are separate destinations for her automatic scenes.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Story_Beat_85_Alliance_Continuation"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>The first introductions do not guarantee Acquaintance (50). Meet Zodiac and Chamel, complete the gate encounter, then continue Zodiac’s collection missions. All scenes below complete once; re-enter the named location when ready.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Personal scene</th><th scope="col">Where and what is needed</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Fresh Meat</th><td data-label="Where and what is needed">Enter Big Top; no affection prerequisite</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cat's Eyes</th><td data-label="Where and what is needed">Big Top after Zodiac’s Collecting Dues — The Bar; once: Rogue +1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Taming the Rookie</th><td data-label="Where and what is needed">Prime Transportation Nexus Hub, 07:00–16:59, after New Blood; once: Rogue +1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cat's Out of the Bag</th><td data-label="Where and what is needed">The Den, 00:00–05:59; Known (25); separate from the friendship chain</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Kitten's Got Claws</th><td data-label="Where and what is needed">Big Top; Friend (100)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Ninth Life</th><td data-label="Where and what is needed">Big Top; Close Friend (200), Kitten’s Got Claws complete</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Push Back</th><td data-label="Where and what is needed">Big Top; Crush (400), The Ninth Life complete</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Invitation</th><td data-label="Where and what is needed">Big Top; Romantic (800), The Push Back complete</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Tamed</th><td data-label="Where and what is needed">Big Top; Intimate (1,600), The Invitation complete</td></tr></tbody></table><p>These shared missions are another source of Kitty affection. Their quest prerequisites and Rogue checks are separate from her relationship stage. Follow the Syndicate guide for the surrounding crew missions.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Shared mission</th><th scope="col">Starting point and prerequisite</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The New Variable</th><td data-label="Starting point and prerequisite">The Parlor; initial shared introduction</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">New Blood</th><td data-label="Starting point and prerequisite">Fortune Teller’s Booth, after Collecting Dues — The Bar</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lines on the Board</th><td data-label="Starting point and prerequisite">The Parlor; Cat’s Eyes, Poison’s Street Knowledge and The Boss Takes Notice</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Open Doors</th><td data-label="Starting point and prerequisite">Fortune Teller’s Booth; previous council scene, Rogue 50</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Invisible</th><td data-label="Starting point and prerequisite">Synergy Corp Corporate Tower; Open Doors</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Honeypot</th><td data-label="Starting point and prerequisite">Motley’s Lair; Invisible, Rogue 55</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Plan Survives</th><td data-label="Starting point and prerequisite">The Parlor; The Honeypot and Chamel’s Faces</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Bug</th><td data-label="Starting point and prerequisite">Synergy Corp Corporate Tower; No Plan Survives</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Badge and Bluster</th><td data-label="Starting point and prerequisite">Syndicate Gates; The Weight of a Secret</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Second Knock</th><td data-label="Starting point and prerequisite">Syndicate Gates; previous gate scene and The Weight of a Secret</td></tr></tbody></table><p>After Story 77, alternate Saber’s three H2Hs with their shared scenes: Off Duty Means Off Duty at Barracks (Saber Friend, Kitty Acquaintance), Crossing the Line at Training Hall (Saber Close Friend, Kitty Friend), then No One Stands Outside at Barracks (both Crush). All three start at 18:00–22:59 and require the preceding Saber H2H. See Saber for the exact alternating steps.</p><p>After Story 85 and After the Line, a separate optional alliance chain uses these locations in order. Each entry requires the previous one. Follow its scenes for their story outcomes.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Alliance scene</th><th scope="col">Location</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Room for Reinforcements</th><td data-label="Location">Operations Center</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Not for Free</th><td data-label="Location">The Parlor</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Third Knock</th><td data-label="Location">Syndicate Gates</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Long Way Out</th><td data-label="Location">Funhouse</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Terms of Command</th><td data-label="Location">The Parlor</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">What She Built</th><td data-label="Location">Motley’s Lair</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Our War</th><td data-label="Location">The Parlor</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements, cost and limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Requirements, cost and limit">Acquaintance (50); 15 min; +1 base affection; five/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Rogue Training</th><td data-label="Requirements, cost and limit">Acquaintance (50); 60 min, $150, 20 Energy; Rogue +1, +3 base affection; three/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">On the Prowl</th><td data-label="Requirements, cost and limit">Crush (400), 18:00–21:59; 120 min, $80, 30 Energy; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Kitty Style</th><td data-label="Requirements, cost and limit">1,000 ordinary affection; 30 min, 20 Energy; +80 base affection; once/day</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Her date and animation are independent of the personal scene chain. Her favorite stats are Ability, Perception and Charm, and Acrobatics improves her relationship bonus. The current portrait has no ordinary gift action; use missions and, after Acquaintance, the repeatable actions above.</p><p>Time windows below are <strong>start times</strong>; 22:59 is the last minute of a window ending at 23:00. Base affection is adjusted by the relationship bonuses; direct affection is added as listed.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>Talk and training locked: both require Acquaintance (50); the initial meetings cannot be repeated to bypass this.</li><li>Cat’s Eyes needs the Robot Bar collection mission, not just a visit to Robot Bar.</li><li>Taming the Rookie starts at the Transportation Nexus Hub before 17:00, after New Blood.</li><li>Later Big Top scenes each require the previous personal scene as well as their stage. 1,000 affection unlocks Kitty Style, not Intimate (1,600).</li><li>Saber’s middle shared scene is in Training Hall, not Barracks. Check both women’s stages.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships — affection stages and reward bonuses</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-chaos-syndicate.html">Syndicate — collection missions and crew progression</a></li><li><a href="character-zodiac.html">Zodiac — collection missions</a></li><li><a href="character-chamel.html">Chamel — shared mission prerequisites</a></li><li><a href="character-saber.html">Saber — shared evening route</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Story progress</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shared_Scenes_with_Saber"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Best_Syndicate_Choice_Bonuses"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shared_Syndicate_Missions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kitty_Style"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-On_the_Prowl_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_Relationship_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Cat.27s_Eyes_and_Taming_the_Rookie"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Cat's_Eyes_and_Taming_the_Rookie"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Meeting_Kitty_and_Unlocking_Talk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Kitty 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kitty.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Kitty 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kitty.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Kitty 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Kitty是辛迪加的大帐篷联系人。前期先通过共同任务积累好感，才能开放可重复的交谈与盗贼训练。个人事件随后按好感阶段推进，另有可选约会、动画，以及后期与Saber共同参与的事件。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Schedule_and_Daily_Actions"></span><h2>去哪里找</h2><p><strong>未来时代核心区，辛迪加大门内的大帐篷，全天可见。</strong>在大门选择“前往议事厅”完成共同介绍，再用“前往大帐篷”初次见Kitty。巢穴及核心区交通枢纽是另外两个自动事件地点。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Story_Beat_85_Alliance_Continuation"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>最初几次见面不保证直接达到相识（50）。先认识Zodiac和Chamel、完成大门事件，再继续Zodiac的收款任务。下表事件均只完成一次；满足条件后重新进入对应地点。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">个人事件</th><th scope="col">地点与条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">新鲜血液</th><td data-label="地点与条件">进入大帐篷；没有好感前置</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">猫眼</th><td data-label="地点与条件">完成Zodiac的“收取保护费 - 酒吧”后进入大帐篷；仅一次：盗贼+1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">驯服菜鸟</th><td data-label="地点与条件">完成“新血”后，07:00–16:59进入核心区交通枢纽；仅一次：盗贼+1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">秘密已泄露</th><td data-label="地点与条件">巢穴00:00–05:59；已知（25）；独立于下方朋友路线</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">小猫也有利爪</th><td data-label="地点与条件">大帐篷；朋友（100）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">第九条命</th><td data-label="地点与条件">大帐篷；亲密朋友（200），完成“小猫也有利爪”</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">顶回去</th><td data-label="地点与条件">大帐篷；迷恋（400），完成“第九条命”</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">邀请</th><td data-label="地点与条件">大帐篷；浪漫感（800），完成“顶回去”</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">被驯服</th><td data-label="地点与条件">大帐篷；亲密（1600），完成“邀请”</td></tr></tbody></table><p>共同任务也会增加Kitty好感。任务前置及盗贼属性检查，与她自己的好感阶段分开计算；周边成员任务请结合辛迪加指南推进。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">共同任务</th><th scope="col">起点与前置</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">新变量</th><td data-label="起点与前置">议事厅；最初的共同介绍</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">新血</th><td data-label="起点与前置">占卜摊位；完成“收取保护费 - 酒吧”</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">板上的线索</th><td data-label="起点与前置">议事厅；完成“猫眼”、Poison的“街头情报”和“老大注意到了你”</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">敞开大门</th><td data-label="起点与前置">占卜摊位；完成前一议事事件，盗贼50</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">隐形</th><td data-label="起点与前置">新能集公司企业塔；完成上一项</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">美人计</th><td data-label="起点与前置">Motley的巢穴；完成上一项，盗贼55</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">计划终成泡影</th><td data-label="起点与前置">议事厅；完成上一项及Chamel的“千面”</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">窃听器</th><td data-label="起点与前置">新能集公司企业塔；完成上一项</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">徽章与虚张声势</th><td data-label="起点与前置">辛迪加大门；完成“秘密的重量”</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">第二次敲门</th><td data-label="起点与前置">辛迪加大门；完成上一大门事件及“秘密的重量”</td></tr></tbody></table><p>完成主线77后，与Saber的三次谈心交替推进共同事件：“下班意味着下班”在兵营（Saber朋友、Kitty相识）；“越线”在训练厅（Saber亲密朋友、Kitty朋友）；“外面没有人站着”回到兵营（两人都迷恋）。三场均在18:00–22:59开始，并要求完成前一次Saber谈心；完整交替顺序见Saber指南。</p><p>完成主线85和“防线之后”后，还有一条独立的可选联盟支线。按下表顺序前往，每项都要求完成上一项；故事发展留在事件中体验。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">联盟事件</th><th scope="col">地点</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">为援军留个位置</th><td data-label="地点">作战中心</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不是白帮忙</th><td data-label="地点">议事厅</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">第三次敲门</th><td data-label="地点">辛迪加大门</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">绕远路脱身</th><td data-label="地点">欢乐屋</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">指挥的条件</th><td data-label="地点">议事厅</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">她亲手建立的</th><td data-label="地点">Motley的巢穴</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">我们的战争</th><td data-label="地点">议事厅</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件、消耗与次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="条件、消耗与次数">相识（50）；15分钟；基础好感+1；每天5次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">游荡者训练</th><td data-label="条件、消耗与次数">相识（50）；60分钟、$150、20精力；盗贼+1、基础好感+3；每天3次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">夜游</th><td data-label="条件、消耗与次数">迷恋（400），18:00–21:59；120分钟、$80、30精力；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Kitty式</th><td data-label="条件、消耗与次数">普通好感1000；30分钟、20精力；基础好感+80；每天1次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>约会及动画独立于个人事件链。她偏好的属性为能力、感知和魅力，杂技可提高关系加成。目前头像菜单没有普通送礼行动；前期做共同任务，达到相识后再用可重复行动培养关系。</p><p>下表时间均指<strong>开始行动的时间</strong>；例如，结束于23:00的时段，最晚可在22:59开始。基础好感会受关系加成影响；直接好感按所列数值增加。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>交谈和训练被锁：两项都需要相识（50），不能重复初次见面来补足。</li><li>“猫眼”要求完成机器人酒吧的收款任务，只去过酒吧还不够。</li><li>“驯服菜鸟”在完成“新血”后，于17:00前进入核心区交通枢纽触发。</li><li>大帐篷后续事件同时要求前一事件和对应好感阶段。1000好感开放Kitty式，尚不等于亲密（1600）。</li><li>与Saber的中间一场共同事件在训练厅，不在兵营；别忘了检查两人各自的阶段。</li></ul></section>
